    <div class="description-paragraph">As is evident from the data shown in Table 3, all solid composition according to the invention showed good results in all tests.</div>
    <div class="description-paragraph">On the contrary, none of the composition of the comparative examples could pass all the tests.</div>
    <heading>TEST EXAMPLE 1</heading>
    <div class="description-paragraph">The solid composition Example 1 and a commercially available tack paper were tested for the relationship between adhesion (holding power) and applied pressure. The results obtained are shown in Table 4.</div>
    <div class="description-paragraph">
