    <div class="description-paragraph">As is evident from the data shown in Table 4, the adhesion significantly increased with the increase in applied pressure with the sample of Example 1. No great changes were observed in the reference example; after arrival at a certain value, the adhesion remained at a relatively low, constant level.</div>
    
